                "text": "The FDA agrees. Doctors agree. Patients agree. Mifepristone is a safe, effective medication to manage the end of a pregnancy. It\u2019s a critical tool in women\u2019s health. This SCOTUS case isn\u2019t about health; it\u2019s about limiting women\u2019s rights. They\u2019re coming for birth control next.",
