                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Early this morning, I voted against Trump\u2019s handout to the wealthy. The only ones who benefit from this are billionaires like Elon Musk, and it\u2019s all coming at the expense of working Michigan families. Michiganders are going to see even higher prices, less health coverage, and more chaos and uncertainty.\n\n750,000 Michiganders are going to lose their health coverage, meaning less people in the workforce and less people getting the healthcare treatment they need.\n\nAnd they\u2019re even putting new investments in Michigan\u2019s auto industry at risk, jeopardizing our ability to lead the manufacturing industries of the future, increasing costs even more on consumers, and creating more chaos and more uncertainty for our manufacturers.\n\nWe need to stop the Trump-Musk chaos, and that\u2019s exactly what I\u2019m going to keep fighting to do.",
