                "text": "The CBO declaring that Trump\u2019s budget will kick 11 million people off their health coverage and increase the debt by $2.4 trillion.\n\nThat's won't fly for working Michiganders, especially when Trump is giving tax handouts to the very top of the 1%.\n\nRead my statement below\u2b07\ufe0f\u2b07\ufe0f https://t.co/snVY3hOgdY",
