                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For weeks, I\u2019ve heard from Michiganders worried about what these cuts would mean. Now the reality of Trump\u2019s bill is setting in: rural hospitals shutting down, and hundreds of thousands at risk of losing their health care.\n\nI\u2019ve been pushing back from the start, and I\u2019ll keep doing everything I can to protect the care people count on. Michigan deserves better.",
